# Plays every land placement effect on the world map in turn after the exit-to-map route, for the probe's fill figures; about 14 minutes.
wait state 2
wait 600
capture title
press DOWN 6
wait 30
press CROSS 6
wait state 7
wait 240
capture overlay-cload
mash CIRCLE 30 state 2
wait 600
